WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.480
Solitaire

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.590
Huh?

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.480
You met someone posing as me?

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.070
I see.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.630
What a hassle, huh?

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.690
You don't know the half of it!

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.160
You have no idea what we've been through while you were gone!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.600
We obtained the Magical Lovely Pad!

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.800
Ai grew out of her grumpy phase!

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.000
Did you even notice that we got a whole new Precure?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.810
A pleasure to meet you, Cure Ace.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.970
I heard about you from Ann.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.000
From Princess Ann?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.950
What do you mean?

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.780
As you can see, Ann has yet to awaken.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.700
But I haven't spent all this time doing nothing.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:48.590
What's this?

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:52.840
One of the Sacred Treasures, the Eternal Golden Crown.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.110
Huh?!

00:00:59.030 --> 00:00:59.040
{OP}

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:05.260
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.730
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.580
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.630
Every day it sparkles

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.290
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:23.200
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:34.500
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.950
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:45.650
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:54.540
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.200
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.600
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.430
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.230
What's more than just cute

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:08.100
is our promise between girls

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:14.140
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:20.050
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:32.060
The Fated Battle!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:32.060
The Fated Battle!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.210
Just where did you find this?

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.680
It was shortly after I separated from you girls.

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.010
<i>Jonathan...</i>

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:45.870
Ai?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.150
<i>Jonathan...</i>

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.490
Ann...

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.460
<i>I speak to you through Ai's magic.</i>

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:05.070
<i>The girl who shall become love's trump card will soon awaken.</i>

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.770
<i>Ai must journey to her.</i>

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.460
<i>In the near future,</i>

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.580
<i>King Selfish's resurrection will be complete.</i>

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.970
<i>Before that comes to pass, Jonathan,</i>

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:23.270
<i>I'd like you to search for one of the Sacred Treasures, the Golden Crown.</i>

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:37.440
And after following Ann's request, I arrived at this Sacred Treasure.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.000
I see.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.590
Let's give it a try!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.810
Okay!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:47.170
Kyupirappa kyupirappa puu puu puu!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:51.040
Wow!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.390
This is the last of the three Sacred Treasures!

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:56.820
The circlet said to be imbued with all the wisdom of the world,

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.360
the Eternal Golden Crown!

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:05.570
Legend has it that this circlet of gold grants its knowledge only to those whom it deems worthy.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:11.520
I believe that you girls have what it takes to master this crown.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:12.950
Also...

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.410
Nothing's happening.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.910
You just put it on?!

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.310
Be careful!

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.290
That treasure is ten thousand years old!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.960
Handle it with delicacy!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.130
Aguri!

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.320
Have you awakened?

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.740
Grandmother...

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:15.600
Mana and the others carried you here.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:23.130
I see...

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.680
Grandmother,

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.120
what should I do?

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.360
I've learned everything.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:45.070
I know who I am and what destiny I was born to meet.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:50.920
It is a grave, tragic fate...

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.480
It is too heavy...

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.690
for my shoulders to bear...

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:00.560
I...

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.940
I...

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:16.920
No matter how painful it may be, everyone must follow their destiny.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:18.520
But...

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.170
you can either let destiny throw you around

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.400
or stand and carve your own path toward it.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.470
It all depends on you.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.350
I'm sure you already know...

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.390
exactly what to do.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.030
Thank you, Grandmother.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:52.800
I'll waver no more!

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:07.800
Hey. I see she called you, too.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:08.940
Joe...

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.520
We're all here.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.670
Why'd you bring Ai too?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.690
So, what's this important chat?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:17.780
This.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.220
Princess!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.450
What have you done?!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.320
What we saw until now was but an illusion.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:38.220
A shadow the princess created to stall the Selfish and divert their attention!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:44.010
The Golden Crown has revealed everything to me.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:49.000
We will discuss the truth of the hidden kingdom.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.530
Solitaire

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.430
No...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.970
It can't be...

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.590
I can't believe it...

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.570
But if what you say is true,

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:14.940
then all the pieces fall right into place.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.460
Cure Sword, Davi, Jonathan,

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:24.420
I thank you from the bottom of my heart for all you've done for the princess.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:30.980
I will leave for Trump Kingdom to end our battle with Regina.

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:35.380
I ask of you to see the battle through with your own eyes.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.560
End?

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.460
Wait, why are we leaving Mana out of this?

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:41.760
If we tell her, I'm sure—

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.390
That is not an option.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:44.670
Aguri!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:51.560
Mana would certainly seek a peaceful resolution.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:56.650
She wouldn't be able to bear either me or Regina falling in battle...

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:04.630
But we cannot avoid a battle we were destined to have.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.440
Don't try to stop me.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:13.040
If you cannot accept what I've told you, then please leave.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.670
I'll go.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.440
What about you?

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.420
They're late.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.870
Where could they be?

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:38.830
I'm certain they're grocery shopping for a New Year's feast!

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.430
Bad news!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.180
Ai's gone too!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.470
Excuse me!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.290
Eru!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:50.140
Is... Aguri here?

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:54.610
Did something happen?

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:58.340
Yesterday, Aguri came to my house...

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.720
I drew this shortly after Career Day.

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:06.890
It's a picture of my friends!

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.920
Thank you!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.000
But what's the occasion?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.170
I simply wanted you to know how I feel.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.480
Adieu!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.780
Aguri seemed different from normal.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:28.350
I got the feeling I'd never see her again,

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.420
so I came here...

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.920
I tried going to Aguri's house,

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.750
but she was gone!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.760
Let's look for them ourselves!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.350
Seconds!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.230
Right away!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.040
She seems a bit moody.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:58.270
<i>Regina, can you come back one more time?</i>

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.780
<i>Mana, you've got no idea how I feel...</i>

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:09.480
Well, whatever the case, it sure seems like King Selfish is gonna be back any day now, huh?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.780
Shut up already!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.590
What do <i>you</i> know?

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.410
Oh, I'm shak—

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:24.900
It's you!

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:26.470
Why are you here?!

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:32.210
Because it is my destiny to end this battle.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:33.960
Regina.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.220
You hit your head?

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.420
That's...

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.150
It can't be...

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.060
The Eternal Golden Crown!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.060
It is indeed.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:51.850
I challenge you to wager your Dragon Glaive against my Golden Crown...

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.260
in a duel!

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.020
Sounds like fun!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:05.940
I've always wanted to mop the floor with you!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.950
I accept your challenge.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.240
Ai, let us go.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.950
Precure Dress Up!

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:18.950
Kyupirappa!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.830
Precure Love Link!

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:27.850
L-O-V-E!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:28.600
L-O-V-E!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.310
L-O-V-E!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.360
L-O-V-E!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.740
Love's trump card,

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.090
Cure Ace!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.610
The blade of courage,

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:56.660
Cure Sword!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.390
I won't let you interfere!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.920
Stay silent and watch.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.310
Who put you in charge?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.570
Cure Ace is my prey!

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:10.770
You three can stand there and watch.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.120
Let us go!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.470
Now let's see what Regina's made of...

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.070
What're you running away for?

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:19.110
You can't end a fight like that!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.140
Never thought you'd be this boring!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:23.840
Geez!

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:29.480
You've sealed your own fate.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.490
Why you...

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.170
Let go!

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:50.640
Get her, Dragon Glaive!

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.910
Don't finish <i>us</i> off with her!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.960
You musn't avert your eyes!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.090
But...

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:14.430
This is the destiny she chose!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.910
Seeing whether Regina or Cure Ace proves victorious...

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.920
is what we were brought here to—

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.650
I know!

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:30.980
I know, but...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:36.320
even if we truly can't avoid this fate...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.260
it's still too painful!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.490
Aguri!

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:44.170
Those two were here.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.930
Jonathan's gone too!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.500
What happened to the princess?

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:50.760
What the heck happened?

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.100
The Ace of Spades? {I know she says "card," but come on. It's the Ace of Spades.}

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.700
What's it doing?

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.620
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:18.170
Not bad.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:21.930
Of course.

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.860
But you think you can win this?

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:27.020
Your five minutes are almost up.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:30.130
And you won't remain a Precure once they are.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:33.840
You underestimate me.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:38.190
I no longer have any manner of time limit.

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:42.310
With the wisdom of the Golden Crown, the true Ace has awakened.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.190
What?! That's cheating!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:46.920
Ace Mirror Flash!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.190
It's over!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.770
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:54.310
Ace Shot!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.760
Bang!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.800
You won't make a fool of me!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:49.320
Is this truly the only way to settle this?

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.800
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:57.190
<i>Are we to do nothing...</i>

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:00.870
<i>but watch these two wound each other?</i>

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:07.830
A no-holds-barred battle between two Sacred Treasure wielders won't end with a few bruises.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.670
So if I take both Treasures once they're too weak to oppose...

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.400
I'll be Numero Uno.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.880
Selfish!

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.510
Go, Selfishes!

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:22.320
Defeat Cure Ace!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.960
<i>And Regina shortly after!</i>

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:26.270
This guy!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.930
He's trying to steal the show!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.730
Ace! Regina!

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.330
You promised to stay out of it!

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:38.730
I don't recall saying anything of the sort.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.570
What're you doing?

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:47.170
<i>I don't even know who's right anymore!</i>

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:47.910
<i>But still...</i>

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:49.840
<i>I...</i>

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:56.620
<i>I don't want to lose Aguri </i>or<i> Regina!</i>

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:02.060
<i>Someone... save them!</i>

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:07.730
Mana!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:18.610
Self! Self!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.010
Selfish!

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:21.240
What?!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:35.810
Girls!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.580
Girls...

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:44.410
Let's do something about these Selfishes first,

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.370
Ace!

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:47.670
I understand.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:51.140
Get them, Selfishes!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.840
Seeeelf!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.920
Kyupirappa!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:31.210
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.790
Self... Seeeelf!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.190
Nope!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:49.040
Love love looooove!

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:01.350
Please move.

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:02.400
No way!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:05.820
Why did you two have to fight this much?!

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:10.360
Because it is our destiny to do so.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:17.390
What's with all your "destiny" stuff?

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:26.670
Since you've come this far, I've no choice but to tell you.

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:31.900
The two of us are decidedly incompatible.

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:39.650
Because we are the light and the shadow born from Princess Ann!

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.080
The princess's...

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.310
Light...

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.420
and shadow?

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:05.040
{ED}

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:14.050
The memories that the Eternal Golden Crown etched into my mind revealed the truth.

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:17.050
Why King Selfish was born,

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:19.580
and the tragedy that befell Princess Ann...

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:23.820
Mana, you all have the right to know.

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:25.790
If you wish, I shall reveal it to you, as well.

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:28.590
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:31.730
Ace and Regina!

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:31.730
Ace and Regina!

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.600
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
